 "review": "Exact English, Arabic and Persian marine names reviewed for the current coverage gap. These are Relic alias decisions, not asserted publisher translations. No generic gulf, sea, strait or country aliases. v2 (27 September 2026) adds 23 SeaVoX sub-regions covering the seas reported by current sources. \"South China Sea\" names the publisher's broader South China and Eastern Archipelagic Seas area. Generic \"Mediterranean\", \"Baltic Sea\" and \"the Gulf\" stay unaliased because they would name more than one area. v3 (27 September 2026) adds the Gulf of Finland, named in current reports. The Atlantic Ocean stays unaliased because SeaVoX splits it into four sub-regions; Bab el-Mandeb has no SeaVoX area.",
